## Erlang VM arguments
## Node name and cookie are managed by RELEASE_NODE and RELEASE_COOKIE
## environment variables (set in env.sh.eex or deployment config).

## Increase number of concurrent ports/sockets
## +Q 65536

## Tweak GC to run more often
## +K true

## EPMD port range for cluster communication
## -kernel inet_dist_listen_min 9100 inet_dist_listen_max 9155
